When you build AI capacity, never let someone else own your critical path.

@IREN_Ltd went from bare Texas dirt in June 2025 to a 19,000-GPU cluster @Microsoft accepted in August 2026, running design, construction and power itself.

Speed comes from owning the boring parts.

A training run goes NaN @ 3am keeps billing &amp; costing $ in GPU cost until you wake up.

Babysit watches the log for Hermes agent with 0 model calls. In the demo it froze the job 2.28 s after the NaN line, woke the agent, and confirmed the restart got past step 60.

